NOTE ON CULTURAL CONTENT

The MIT license above applies to the software source code only.

Cultural content included in this repository — including but not limited to
Nso calendar data, Lamnso terminology, cultural event descriptions,
traditional knowledge, oral history, audio recordings, and photographs —
may be subject to separate licensing terms.

The licensing model for cultural content will be defined before the first
public release of Yanso, in consultation with Nso cultural authorities and
contributors.

Until that model is defined, cultural content in this repository should be
treated as All Rights Reserved unless a specific content file states otherwise.
